Hi,

I'm applying a detection history data file (created in camtrapR) to a single-season occupancy model in unmarked. I'm trying to subdivide the detection history file dates into two sampling periods within the same season, to then analyze them comparatively, along with additional covariates. Does anyone know how to use a code to subdivide the data into two sampling periods?

I've attached a sample data sheet of the detection history data: "det_hist_sample2.csv".

Any help would be greatly appreciated!!!!

Thanks!

Angie

