Hi Rob, that worked, thank you!!!

For anyone wondering, here is the overall solution in code that I used:

#this will take all the detection/non-detection data for the first 6 ocasions
umf1 <- unmarkedFrameOccu(y = data[,2:7],

                          siteCovs = data.frame(canopy = canopy, dist = dist, NF = NF, EP = EP))

#this will take all the detection/non-detection data for the last 6 occasions
umf2 <- unmarkedFrameOccu(y = data[,8:13],

                          siteCovs = data.frame(canopy = canopy, dist = dist, NF = NF, EP = EP))

#this includes all occasions

umf <- unmarkedFrameOccu(y = y, siteCovs = data.frame(canopy = canopy, dist = dist, NF = NF, EP = EP))

summary(umf)

Best,
Angie

